<title>CHILE: Chile November fishmeal exports fall slightly.</title>
<headline>Chile November fishmeal exports fall slightly.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean fishmeal exports dropped to $34.8 million in November from $38.8 million in the same month last year, said the Central Bank in its monthly report.</p>
<p>Fishmeal exports totalled $627.7 million last year compared with $449.2 million in 1994.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
